			"notes": "Colorful Campfires adds 640 unique  campfires to Minecraft. For anyone who wished for more campfire options, this is the mod for you! Each Vanilla wood type has a regular and stripped campfire variant with different color flames for each of the vanilla dyes. For those wanting a little twist, adding black dye the recipe in addition to the regular dye will create a Darkfire variant! \n\nAlso includes QoL recipes for turning logs to stripped logs and vice versa.\n\nCompatibilities:\n\n- JEI (recomended)\n- Polymorph (recomended)\n- Smoke Signals via Sinytra\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Cha0ticCreations/Colorful_Campfires-1.20.1/commits/Colorful_Campfires"
		}
